\begin{remark}[Bianchi identity and operator squares]\label{rem:bianchi-identity-operator-squares}


Notice that neither ${\mathcal T}^{2}$ nor ${\mathcal T}^{\sharp}$
satisfies the Bianchi identity, but their sum does.
\end{remark}

